{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-06_beg","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-06","title":"疑兵之計","storyCode":"5-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"667e5c77d1f2f4bbb05d8fdfff974a4092d64e9d222f17b24e3f1828ffaf61f2","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第五关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_emporium"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"不對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你又要幹什麼，病發了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"這和切爾諾伯格完全不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們損失不小，但我們戰勝切爾諾伯格人的過程中，也看到了那些敵人的掙扎，還有那些幫兇逃竄的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"這龍門卻像座空城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"難道不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"大古廣場，這麼大的大樓，這麼多的商鋪，卻一個人都沒有啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我逛了一圈，昂貴的商品都只剩下標牌了！都被拿走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"愛國者不是說過，不允許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是那個意思。你知道，梅菲斯特隨便我們幹什麼，但這不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說，好像有人提前把這些東西收起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你又在瞎想了。龍門束手無策！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們從各處突然湧了出來，哪裡都有我們，*烏薩斯粗口*，就像在切爾諾伯格時一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"這回我們不毀掉它，我們要奪下它，把它當做我們的城市！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"知道什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"大古廣場是離近衛局最近的據點，從這裡很快就能趕到近衛局，支援他們也很方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"上次通報講過了，我聽過這段。其他的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"各處的整合運動理應在近衛局附近匯合，然後向外擴散，接管整座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是很清楚我們周遭隊伍的分佈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"但其他區域的隊伍呢？我知道很多支隊伍都正向近衛局這裡移動，但更多的隊伍消失了，消失得無影無蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"消失......是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"很神秘。他們的話筒開著，卻一點聲音都沒傳出來。我們沒法聯繫上他們了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"馬上也沒人能聯繫上你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，誰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"窗戶！在窗戶外面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"有敵人！敵人在攻擊我們，近衛局，是近衛局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，是近衛局沒錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡！難道是從頂樓掛繩下來，跳進窗戶的嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"戰鬥！動起來！我們的人數遠比他們多，消滅他們就行了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊，給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes sir！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局聽好！把整合運動連同他們的掩體統統砸個粉碎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":true,"text":"（龍門粗口），你要幹嘛？！大古廣場是我家的財產！你憑什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，“小姐”，整合運動負隅頑抗，先摧毀他們的戰鬥力才是第一優先順序......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼！！！你這條仆街龍！！你！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局！進攻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我的天。哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你們注意點，這怎麼說也是市民財產。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那台鋼琴他們沒抬走，估計太重了。但值個一百八十萬龍門幣，“小姐”向我吹噓過的，小心點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動術師","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"你們跑不了了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"找掩體！快！躲在那架鋼琴後面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"它打破了我們的掩體！轉移！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"一百八十萬......炸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"其他同胞，其他同胞！聽著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們佔據了龍門的大古廣場作為據點，也做好了防禦準備，但近衛局從廣場高層突襲了我們！他們正在削減我們的人數！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"通報！！近衛局的主力，在大古廣場！大古廣場！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"彙報完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你什麼時候——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你已經彙報完畢了，那你的任務就已經完成了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"讓整個龍門的整合運動都知道我們在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我們等著他們來，等著他們追逐我們，等著和他們在近衛局決一死戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局！繼續攻擊！別停火！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["詩懷雅","陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","aliases":["整合運動術師"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["詩懷雅"]}]}
